{"title":"테러","artist":"Neru","sourceId":"reference:Ynst7rG8ZHGzHr2nxxy0","sourceHash":"ad2daca3751994001a745b015eef32c479725da47dbeb376e2753a6189d4700e","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":20330652,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.25,"end":5.14,"text":"言葉になんてならない手紙をひたすら書いてさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":5.14,"end":10.23,"text":"明日の自分に送りつけてやろうと思ったが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":10.23,"end":15.54,"text":"そんな住所なんてない どこにいるかもわからない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":15.54,"end":20.6,"text":"なら僕は この気持ちをどうすりゃいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":20.6,"end":25.4,"text":"なりたくない自分になれた気分はどうですか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":25.4,"end":30.21,"text":"遥か彼方 天国で神様が指を指し笑う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":30.21,"end":35.63,"text":"黙れこの役立たず 早く何処か行ってくれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":35.63,"end":40.44,"text":"さめざめと 惨めさだけが募ってく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":40.44,"end":45.3,"text":"藪睨（やぶにら）みで愛にそっぽ向いて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":45.3,"end":50.08,"text":"六畳に立て篭もるテロリズム","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":50.08,"end":53.98,"text":"いつだって歌ってきた いや、叫んでたんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":53.98,"end":60.46,"text":"それが間違いというなら 言葉より重い弾で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":60.46,"end":63.01,"text":"射抜いてよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":63.01,"end":65.84,"text":"やられたらやり返せ 君の番だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":65.84,"end":68.15,"text":"捨てた夢の全てを拉致（らち）しろ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":68.15,"end":72.96000000000001,"text":"心の居場所を賭（と）したレジスタンス","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":72.96000000000001,"end":75.99,"text":"笑われたその分だけ 笑い返せ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":75.99,"end":78.59,"text":"言わば人生のクーデター","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":78.59,"end":82.51,"text":"勝ちも負けない 延長戦","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":82.51,"end":88.28999999999999,"text":"僕らの反撃前夜","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":88.28999999999999,"end":93.97,"text":"歌にすれば何か変わると本気で思ってた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":93.97,"end":99.05,"text":"恥ずかしげも 後ろめたさもなく ただ思ってた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":99.05,"end":104.3,"text":"征服だの何だの 抜かした奴はどいつだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":104.3,"end":108.99000000000001,"text":"そんな事言う 大馬鹿者はいないよな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":108.99000000000001,"end":118.03,"text":"心一つない群集の声に 怯え立て篭もるテロリズム","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":118.03,"end":121.9,"text":"そうやって拒んできた いや、逃げてきたんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":121.9,"end":129.37,"text":"これが最後のチャンスなら こんな最悪な舞台","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":129.37,"end":131.6,"text":"ごめんだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":131.6,"end":134.07,"text":"やられたらやり返せ 君の番だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":134.07,"end":136.69,"text":"罵倒や野次の類（たぐい）は無視しろ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":136.69,"end":141.45,"text":"心の傷から漏れた メーデー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":141.45,"end":143.9,"text":"笑われたその分だけ 笑い返せ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":143.9,"end":146.71,"text":"一部屋で起きた インティファーダ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":146.71,"end":150.69,"text":"兵士も指揮もいない 防衛戦","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":150.69,"end":161.42000000000002,"text":"僕らの革命前夜","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":161.42000000000002,"end":164.52,"text":"ボロボロになってでも奪い返せ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":164.52,"end":167.01,"text":"君の心は君だけの物","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":167.01,"end":171.84,"text":"命は輝いてこそ命だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":171.84,"end":174.66,"text":"転んでも 倒れても 躓（つまず）いても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":174.66,"end":177.21,"text":"進もうとした証拠だから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":177.21,"end":182.02,"text":"それを笑うなんて最低だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":182.02,"end":187.12,"text":"それでも地球って奴は回るんだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":187.12,"end":194.26,"text":"そうだろ そうだろ 答えておくれよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}